sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant InventoryItem as InventoryItem
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+InventoryItem: setExpiry(bestBeforeAt, useByAt)
    Note over InventoryItem: Policies: inventoryItemRead, inventoryItemWrite, inventoryItemExecute
    Note over InventoryItem: Guards (2)
    InventoryItem->>InventoryItem: guard[0]: self.stockedAt != null
    InventoryItem->>InventoryItem: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    InventoryItem->>InventoryItem: mutate.bestBeforeAt
    InventoryItem->>InventoryItem: mutate.useByAt
    InventoryItem->>EventBus: emit InventoryExpiryUpdated on inventory_item.expiry_updated
    InventoryItem-->>-Client: void